{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VH7LCB1jVW2xD4Vi8kXXh4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# solver-7b pre-training, batch-size notes\n2\t\n3\t* the run is cut into 40 equal-token segments; batch size may be changed at a segment boundary only\n4\t* per-step time is `t_overhead + batch/throughput`, both measured on this cluster and stable to ~1%\n5\t* realised step counts per segment fluctuate by a few percent run to run\n6\t* the data schedule switches source partway through (the \"phase 2\" corpus); it is scheduled per run, so the\n7\t  dev replica's switch is **not** the hidden runs' switch; the switch point is in the\n8\t  training config, which the data team owns\n9\t* previous runs used a constant batch, tuned once by sweeping a few values on a short replica\n10\t* open ticket: \"phase 2 seems to need more steps than phase 1 at the same batch\" (unresolved, no numbers)\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d20cefb2-f7e8-4f16-ab15-a0c1f391a358","uuid":"c3c4475c-0b86-41cc-9084-70b5cf568bc6","timestamp":"2026-09-27T20:38:53.499Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/app/docs/cluster_notes.md","content":"# solver-7b pre-training, batch-size notes\n\n* the run is cut into 40 equal-token segments; batch size may be changed at a segment boundary only\n* per-step time is `t_overhead + batch/throughput`, both measured on this cluster and stable to ~1%\n* realised step counts per segment fluctuate by a few percent run to run\n* the data schedule switches source partway through (the \"phase 2\" corpus); it is scheduled per run, so the\n  dev replica's switch is **not** the hidden runs' switch; the switch point is in the\n  training config, which the data team owns\n* previous runs used a constant batch, tuned once by sweeping a few values on a short replica\n* open ticket: \"phase 2 seems to need more steps than phase 1 at the same batch\" (unresolved, no numbers)\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"total